JetVHeto was originally written by 

  Andrea Banfi
  Pier Francesco Monni
  Gavin P. Salam 
  Giulia Zanderighi

and implements the resummation and matching described in arXiv:1206.4998 
and arXiv:XXXX.XXXX.

The version v4 implements the N3LL resummation presented in arXiv:XXXX.XXXX,
in collaboration with

  Samuel Abreu
  Jonathan R. Gaunt
  Luca Rottoli
  Robert Szafron

The version v3 also contains the resummation of leading logarithm
in the jet radius described in arXiv:1411.5182. The corresponding code
has been developed by

  Gavin Salam
  Frederic Dreyer